ScandiumUI
===========

Getting started
---------------

ScandiumUI is a custom Android ROM based on PixelOS with additional customizations for Settings, SystemUI, Quick Settings, and Setup Wizard.

Please visit our GitHub organization at [ScandiumUI](https://github.com/ScandiumUI) for source code and build instructions.


Submitting patches
------------------
Patches are always welcome! Please submit your patches via GitHub Pull Requests on the appropriate repository.


Buildbot
--------

All supported devices are built periodically as changes are committed to ensure the source trees remain buildable.
